### Prep Checks
hostname
Get-ComputerInfo | Select-Object `
    WindowsProductName,
    WindowsVersion,
    OsBuildNumber
Get-NetIPConfiguration
Get-NetIPAddress -AddressFamily IPv4
Get-DnsClientServerAddress -AddressFamily IPv4
Get-NetConnectionProfile
Get-WindowsFeature | Where-Object Installed

And check the clock:

Get-Date

Then verify basic connectivity:

Test-Connection 192.168.100.1 -Count 2
Test-Connection 192.168.100.10 -Count 2
Test-Connection 192.168.100.30 -Count 2

Resolve-DnsName google.com

### Check computer name and domain/workgroup state
Get-CimInstance Win32_ComputerSystem |
    Select-Object Name, Domain, PartOfDomain


### Check time synchronization
w32tm /query /status

And:

w32tm /query /source


### Check whether any AD/DNS/DHCP-related roles are already installed
Get-WindowsFeature AD-Domain-Services, DNS, DHCP

### Check WinRM
Get-Service WinRM

and:

Test-WSMan localhost
